    │   transitions-specific feature not directly supported the same way in fysom or python-statemachine; list-based multiple 
    │   source states (e.g. ['HOLDING','FILLING']) may need to be expanded into multiple explicit transition declarations in 
    │   other libraries
    ├── Constraints: requires_connector
    └── transitions is used here to implement a declarative state machine attached to the TankController instance, with 
        conditions and after-callbacks driving state transitions. python-statemachine and fysom are both third-party libraries
        offering similar declarative FSM construction (states, transitions, guard conditions, callbacks) and could in 
        principle replace transitions for this use case.

